# Visual Studio / WDK build artifacts
**/x64/
**/x86/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/*.suo
**/*.user
**/*.userprefs
**/.vs/
**/*.vcxproj.filters
**/*.aps

# NuGet restore output (Microsoft.Windows.WDK + SDK CPP packages)
**/packages/

# Driver-specific build outputs
**/*.dll
**/*.sys
**/*.cat
**/*.pdb
**/*.lib
**/*.exp
**/*.ilk
**/*.idb
**/*.obj
**/*.o

# Generated INF (we keep the source .inx; build produces .inf)
**/*.inf
!**/src/**/*.inx

# Signing artifacts (NEVER commit private keys)
**/*.pfx
**/*.snk
**/*.spc

# Test outputs
test/output/
test/logs/
